builds, and the subject version of "epiphany-browser" got speared.  This
applies to both "testing" and "unstable" distributions.

Workaround: build the package from the current "experimental" source
instead (3.2.0-2).

Why we care: "gnome-core" depends on "epiphany-browser".

--Bob



